@startuml
title Frozen selector comparison and complete native execution
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
rectangle "Freeze once\nGit revisions + paths + E + history\nreviewed policy + legacy bytes" as frozen
rectangle "Legacy daily selector\nretained Python" as legacy
rectangle "Shared ShardPilot engine\nGradle / Maven parameters" as core
rectangle "Review exact sets and statuses\nMATCH / EXPLAINED / REVIEW_REQUIRED" as review
rectangle "Compile once + optional C3 seal\nretained revision and SHA-256 pin" as compile
rectangle "Frozen C5 decision + two plans\ncanonical C2 selection v2" as plan
rectangle "Native worker 1\nC3 guard + original XML / exit" as one
rectangle "Native worker 2\nC3 guard + original XML / exit" as two
rectangle "Artifact-only C2 aggregate\nJSON + HTML\nno regeneration or test reruns" as aggregate
frozen --> legacy
frozen --> core
legacy --> review
core --> review
compile --> plan
core --> plan
plan --> one
plan --> two
one --> aggregate
two --> aggregate
note bottom of review
Local compiled-name inventories are diagnostic.
Production migration needs native eligibility.
No benchmark or automatic service migration.
end note
@enduml
